// The shape of the current row of a statement: how many columns, what type column col holds now (1 integer, 2 float, 3 text, 4 blob, 5 null), and how many bytes it is. Columns count from 0.

native sq_cols(int st) return int;

native sq_ctype(int st, int col) return int;

native sq_cbytes(int st, int col) return int;
